The review personas and the fresh-/blind-context review method grew out of the
BMAD Method (https://github.com/bmad-code-org/BMAD-METHOD) code-review workflow
and the ralph-orchestrator loop (https://github.com/mikeyobrien/ralph-orchestrator).
The reviewer runtime is the pi coding agent (https://pi.dev), driven in CI via
shaftoe/pi-coding-agent-action. Each is used under its own license. See
ATTRIBUTION.md.
